acknowledgment from Cardholder or authorized person (for example: signature, PIN, collection code)', 'NL', NULL, false, NULL, 'collection acknowledged by the cardholder', 'goods bought remotely — online, by phone or by post — were collected from a store, locker, depot or other collection point, and the collection record carries an acknowledgment by the person collecting, such as a signature, PIN, collection code, ID check or photo at collection.', 'a click-and-collect or locker release record showing the signature or code entered.', 'the goods were delivered to an address, which is the delivery argument; they were bought and taken away in person; or the records show no collection.', 5, 'ALL', NULL)
