merchandise at time of sale', 'NL', NULL, false, NULL, 'merchandise taken at the point of sale', 'the goods were sold in person with the card present, and the records hold the merchant''s statement that the cardholder took them away at the time of sale, or at least the in-person till receipt for them.', 'a signed merchant certification that the goods were handed over at the point of sale, with the till receipt.', 'the sale was remote — online, by phone or by post; the records show the goods were to be delivered or collected later; or what was sold was food and drink served on the premises, which is a service.', 6, 'ALL', NULL)
