did not take place.', 'NL', NULL, false, NULL, 'the flight departed', 'the purchase is a flight, the complaint is — or may be — that the flight did not take place or was cancelled, and the records bear on whether that flight operated: a flight status, departure, operations or manifest record, or coupon details showing it flown.', 'the airline''s own departure or operations record for that flight number and date.', 'the complaint is plainly something else — refused boarding, a missed flight, a cancelled booking or a wrong date; or the records show the flight did not operate, or only a replacement flight departed.', 7, 'ALL', NULL)
