services were available.', 'NL', NULL, false, NULL, 'future services not cancelled and available', 'the service was booked at purchase for a later date, and the merchant''s records show the booking held open — confirmed, not cancelled by the merchant, still valid or bookable, or recorded as a no-show — with nothing showing it used. The date may be still ahead or already past. Nominate even where the issuer''s form says the merchant cancelled, if the merchant''s own records show the booking live.', 'the merchant''s booking or schedule record showing it active and uncancelled, read with a status record showing the flight, event or appointment went ahead or remains scheduled.', 'the records show the service used, which is the services-received argument; they show the merchant cancelled, withdrew or refused it, or that it did not operate; or the only support is the merchant''s general statement that it was available.', 8, 'ALL', NULL)
