non-fungible token(s), evidence the non-fiat currency or non-fungible token(s) was successfully
delivered to the destination wallet address supplied by the Cardholder at the time of the
Transaction and one or both of the following:', 'NL', NULL, false, NULL, 'cryptocurrency delivered to the cardholder''s wallet', 'the purchase was of cryptocurrency, another non-fiat currency or an NFT, and the records bear on its delivery to a wallet the cardholder gave — a withdrawal or transfer record, an order record naming the destination wallet, a blockchain transaction hash, or a screenshot of the transfer — even where the hash or the address is missing.', 'a transfer record showing both the destination wallet address the cardholder supplied and a blockchain transaction hash that can be looked up on a public explorer. The rule above is cut off; those two items are the list it introduces.', 'the payment was an ordinary money transfer to a bank account or a person; the records show the assets were never sent out of an account held with the merchant; or the hash or address shown belongs to a different transfer.', 9, 'ALL', 'COST_CAP_REVIEW')
